  'pulsar.guide.cursors': 'The reference cursor (right button; Shift with the Left/Right arrow keys on a focused panel; or the primary button or touch when it is set to the reference cursor) is shared by all panels, and its time in seconds from the start of the data is shown below the panels. For a panel’s own time, set the primary button or touch to the panel cursor (left button) and select that panel’s vertical cursor readout. Then the left button, touch, or the Left/Right arrow keys on the focused panel place its vertical cursor, read in seconds. The horizontal readout is a relative strength, not a time.',
